[Term]
id: goldbook:08045
name: sampling target
def: "Portion of the material\, at a particular time\, that the sample is intended to represent."
comment: "The sampling target may be defined by Regulations (for example, lot size)."
comment: "The sampling target should be defined prior to designing the sampling plan."
