name: spike
def: "Material with known quantity values added to an analytical sample."
comment: ""Spike" used as a verb is the addition of a spike to a sample."
comment: "A spike may be used to estimate the recovered quantity value ratio or compensate for systematic measurement error."
comment: "The known quantity value is often a fraction or concentration."
comment: "The material can be a reference material or a certified reference material."
