[Term]
id: goldbook:08052
name: acceptance interval
def: "Interval of permissible measured quantity values."
comment: "An acceptance interval is termed an "acceptance zone" in the Eurachem guide on compliance assessment."
comment: "Unless otherwise stated in the specification, the acceptance limits belong to the acceptance interval."
