[Term]
id: goldbook:08053
name: acceptance limit
def: "Specified upper or lower bound of permissible measured quantity values."
comment: "Permissible measured quantity values are associated with items that conform to specified requirements with at least a predetermined conformance probability and lie within the acceptance interval."
