[Term]
id: goldbook:08057
name: assigned value
def: "Value attributed to a particular property of an item and that serves as an agreed reference for comparison."
comment: "Options for establishing an assigned value for some types of proficiency testing schemes are detailed in ISO/IEC 17043 and ISO 13528."
comment: "The value may be a reference quantity value or a value of a nominal property."
