[Term]
id: goldbook:08063
name: certification
def: "Third-party attestation related to products\, processes\, systems\, or persons."
comment: "Certification is applicable to all objects of conformity assessment except for conformity assessment bodies themselves, to which accreditation is applicable."
comment: "Certification of a management system is sometimes also termed registration."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2019-0819
