[Term]
id: goldbook:08067
name: conformity assessment
def: "Activity to determine whether specified requirements relating to a product\, process\, system\, person\, or body are fulfilled."
comment: ""Body" refers to an organization."
comment: "The expression "object of conformity assessment" or "object" is used to encompass any particular material, product, installation, process, system, person, or body to which conformity assessment is applied."
comment: "The subject field of conformity assessment includes activities, such as testing, calibration, carrying out an audit, inspection, and certification, as well as the accreditation of conformity assessment bodies."
