[Term]
id: goldbook:08079
name: in-house reference material
def: "Reference material produced and used by an analytical laboratory."
comment: "The preparation, characterization, and use of in-house reference materials for quality control purposes are described in ISO Guide 80."
comment: "Various terms are used to distinguish among reference materials intended for different uses and with assigned values established applying different procedures."
synonym: "laboratory reference material" []
