[Term]
id: goldbook:08080
name: inspection
def: "Examination of a product\, process\, service\, or installation or their design and determination of conformity with specific requirements or on the basis of professional judgment\, with general requirements."
comment: "If the result of an inspection shows conformity, it can be used for purposes of verification."
comment: "Inspection of processes can include personnel, facilities, technology, or methodology."
comment: "Inspection procedures or schemes can restrict inspection to examination only."
comment: "The result of an inspection can show conformity or non-conformity or a degree of conformity, where conformity is defined as fulfilment of a requirement."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2019-0819
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
