[Term]
id: goldbook:08087
name: measurement capability
def: "Ability to measure a quantity in a specified interval of quantity values\, embodied in a specified material\, as demonstrated by measurement uncertainty."
comment: "A comparison of the measurement uncertainty in the measurement result obtained by one laboratory to that of the measurement result obtained by another laboratory for the same quantity in the same material compares their respective measurement capabilities."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2019-0819
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string

[Term]
id: goldbook:08088
name: measurement precision control material
def: "Quality control material with or without reference quantity value used in quality control to assess measurement precision."
synonym: "precision control material" []
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2019-0819
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
consider: goldbook:08107

[Term]
id: goldbook:08089
name: measurement trueness control material
def: "Quality control material with reference quantity value used in quality control to estimate a systematic measurement error."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2019-0819
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
consider: goldbook:08107

[Term]
id: goldbook:08090
name: method performance study
def: "Intra- or interlaboratory study of one or more performance characteristics of a measurement procedure."
comment: "Details regarding organizing and conducting the study, for example, type of samples and number of measurements, are specified in a validation plan or in a protocol for interlaboratory comparison."
comment: "The general term "collaborative study" should not be used for an interlaboratory method performance study."
comment: "The study is normally conducted in the frame of procedure validation or procedure verification."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2019-0819
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
