consider: goldbook:08061
consider: goldbook:08081
consider: goldbook:08094
consider: goldbook:08122

[Term]
id: goldbook:08098
name: procedure verification
def: "Confirmation\, through the provision of objective evidence\, that the procedure fulfils specified requirements."
comment: "A laboratory that implements a procedure described in, for example, an international standard or in a manufacturer"s documentation needs to verify that the procedure fulfils the specified requirements."
comment: "In ISO/IEC 17025, the term "method" is used as a synonym for measurement procedure."
comment: "The corresponding term in ISO 15189 is "verification of examination procedures"."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2019-0819
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
consider: goldbook:08028
consider: goldbook:08122

[Term]
id: goldbook:08099
name: process in a state of statistical control
def: "Process subject only to random causes."
comment: "A control chart can be used to monitor a process and to determine whether the process is, or is not, in a state of statistical control. See out-of-control criteria and control limit."
comment: "The random variation is considered to follow a Gaussian distribution and is characterized by its variance (standard deviation)"
comment: "This state does not imply that the random variation is large or small, within or outside of specification, but rather that the variation is predictable using statistical techniques."
synonym: "process in statistical control" []
synonym: "stable process" []
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2019-0819
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
consider: goldbook:08068
consider: goldbook:08069
consider: goldbook:08092

[Term]
id: goldbook:08100
name: proficiency test item
def: "Sample\, product\, artefact\, reference material\, piece of equipment\, measurement standard\, data set\, or other information used for proficiency testing."
synonym: "PT item" []
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2019-0819
