[Term]
id: goldbook:08112
name: quality objective
def: "Result to be achieved related to quality."
comment: "In the context of quality management systems, quality objectives are set by the laboratory, consistent with the quality policy, to achieve specific results."
comment: "Quality objectives are generally based on the quality policy of the organization."
comment: "Quality objectives are generally specified for relevant functions, levels and processes in the organization."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2019-0819
