[Term]
id: goldbook:08113
name: quality plan
def: "Specification of the procedures and associated resources to be applied when and by whom to a specific object."
comment: "A quality plan is generally one of the results of quality planning."
comment: "A quality plan often refers to parts of the quality manual or to procedure documents."
comment: "These procedures generally include those referring to quality management processes and to product and service realization processes."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2019-0819
