[Term]
id: goldbook:08114
name: quality planning
def: "Part of quality management focused on setting quality objectives and specifying necessary operational processes and related resources to achieve the quality objectives."
comment: "Establishing quality plans can be part of quality planning."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2019-0819
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
