[Term]
id: goldbook:08115
name: quality policy
def: "Intentions and direction of a laboratory as formally expressed by its top management related to quality."
comment: "Generally, the quality policy is consistent with the overall policy of the laboratory, can be aligned with the laboratory's vision and mission, and provides a framework for the setting of quality objectives."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2019-0819
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
