[Term]
id: goldbook:08119
name: reference material certification report
def: "Document giving detailed information\, in addition to that contained in a reference material certificate."
comment: "The information may refer to, for example, the preparation of the reference material, measurement procedures, factors affecting measurement accuracy, statistical treatment of measurement results, and the way in which metrological traceability was established."
synonym: "certification report" []
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2019-0819
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
