consider: goldbook:08125

[Term]
id: goldbook:08129
name: specified requirement
def: "Need or expectation that is stated."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2019-0819
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
consider: goldbook:08122

[Term]
id: goldbook:08130
name: standard deviation for proficiency assessment
def: "Measure of dispersion used in the evaluation of results of proficiency testing."
comment: "Not all proficiency testing schemes evaluate proficiency based on the dispersion of results."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2019-0819
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
consider: goldbook:08101
consider: goldbook:08104

[Term]
id: goldbook:08131
name: standard operating procedure
def: "Authorized\, documented procedure or set of procedures with detailed instructions for specified activities."
comment: "Laboratory activities for which standard operating procedures are issued include sampling, measurement, testing, and examination."
synonym: "recommended operating procedure" []
synonym: "standard method" []
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2019-0819
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
consider: goldbook:08043
consider: goldbook:08049

[Term]
id: goldbook:08132
name: statistical process control
def: "Activities focused on the use of statistical techniques to reduce variation\, increase knowledge about the process\, and steer the process in the desired way."
comment: "Although statistical process control originally was concerned primarily with manufactured goods, it is also equally applicable to processes producing services, for example, a measurement procedure."
synonym: "SPC" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2019-0819
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
consider: goldbook:08028

[Term]
id: goldbook:08133
name: target measurement uncertainty
def: "Measurement uncertainty specified as an upper limit and decided on the basis of the intended use of measurement results."
comment: "Setting and using target uncertainty is described in."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2019-0819
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string

[Term]
id: goldbook:08134
name: tolerance
def: "Difference between upper and lower tolerance limits."
comment: "Tolerance should not be confused with measurement uncertainty."
synonym: "specified tolerance" []
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2019-0819
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
consider: goldbook:08067
consider: goldbook:08136

[Term]
id: goldbook:08135
name: tolerance interval
def: "Interval of permissible quantity values."
comment: "A permissible quantity value of a specified quantity is required of an item fulfilling a specified requirement."
comment: "Permissible quantity values must not be confused with permissible measured quantity value of an acceptance interval."
comment: "The term "tolerance interval" as used in conformity assessment has a different meaning from the same term as it is used in statistics."
comment: "Unless otherwise stated in a specified requirement, the tolerance limits belong to the tolerance interval."
synonym: "specification zone" []
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2019-0819
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
