consider: goldbook:08375
consider: goldbook:08380

[Term]
id: goldbook:08250
name: Fresnel reflection
def: "Reflection of radiation from a surface that is smooth and large with respect to the wavelength of the radiation. A reflected beam\, of intensity governed by the Fresnel equations\, is produced at an angle of reflection equal to the angle of incidence."
comment: "May be termed specular reflection for non-scattering samples."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2019-0203
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
consider: goldbook:08242
consider: goldbook:08281
consider: goldbook:08292
consider: goldbook:08299

[Term]
id: goldbook:08252
name: Gaussian band
def: "Spectral band with the shape \\\(H_\{\\rm\{G\}\} \\exp\[-4\\ln 2\{\(\\tilde\{ u\} - \\tilde\{ u\}_\{0\}\)\}^\{2\}/W^\{2\}\]\\\)\, where \\\(H_\{\\rm\{G\}\}\\\) is the band maximum \(peak height\)\, \\\(W\\\) is the full width at half maximum\, and \\\(\\tilde\{ u\}_\{0\}\\\) is the peak wavenumber."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2019-0203
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
