[Term]
id: goldbook:08297
name: undersampling
def: "Sampling less frequently than is required by the Nyquist criterion."
comment: "Undersampling occurs when an analogue signal is digitized with less than two data points per wavelength of the shortest wavelength (highest wavenumber) radiation that reaches the detector."
