def: "Heteronuclear \(typically \\\(\\ce\{^\{13\}C\}\\\)\) detected long range 2D correlation experiment in nuclear magnetic resonance spectroscopy that has mostly been superseded by heteronuclear multiple bond correlation \(HMBC\) experiments and its variants."
comment: "COLOC is often used to show spin-spin coupling between hydrogen and carbon nuclei 2 and 3 bonds apart."
