id: goldbook:08374
name: Knight shift
def: "Frequency shift in the nuclear magnetic resonance spectrum of a paramagnetic species that refers to the relative shift \\\(\\boldsymbol\{K\}\\\) in NMR frequency for atoms in a metal \(e.g.\, sodium\) compared with the same atoms in a nonmetallic environment \(e.g.\, as a salt\)."
