[Term]
id: goldbook:08382
name: nuclear electric quadrupole moment
def: "Parameter that describes the effective shape of the ellipsoid of nuclear charge distribution."
comment: "By convention, the value of \(eQ\) is taken to be positive if the ellipsoid is prolate and negative if it is oblate."
comment: "Non-zero quadrupole moment indicates that the charge distribution is not spherically symmetric."
synonym: "quadrupole moment of a nucleus" []
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2019-0203
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string

[Term]
id: goldbook:08383
name: nuclear magnetic resonance relaxometry
def: "Measurement method of nuclear magnetic resonance spectroscopy to measure nuclear relaxation variables."
comment: "NMRR generally involves analysis of time domain NMR signals to generate simplified NMR data rather than conventional full frequency resolved NMR spectra."
synonym: "NMRR" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
synonym: "relaxometry" []
