[Term]
id: goldbook:08384
name: nuclear magnetic resonance spectrum
def: "Representation of nuclear magnetic resonance spectroscopy data with at least one dimension a frequency domain."
comment: "An NMR spectrum typically involves the Fourier transform of a free induction decay. See Fourier-transform spectroscopy."
synonym: "NMR spectrum" []
