id: goldbook:08427
name: static magnetic flux density
def: "Flux density of the magnetic field of a nuclear magnetic resonance spectrometer about whose direction the nuclear magnetic moment precesses."
comment: "Static magnetic induction is related to the magnetic field \(\boldsymbol{H}\) through the equation \(\boldsymbol{B} = \mu \boldsymbol{H}\) where \(\mu\) is the permeability of the material."
comment: "The value of \(\boldsymbol{B_{0}}\) is expressed in Tesla or as the nominal proton precession frequency (e.g., \(\pu{14 T}\) or \(\pu{600 MHz}\))."
synonym: "magnetic flux density" []
synonym: "static magnetic field" []
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2019-0203
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
