id: goldbook:08440
name: wideband\, alternating-phase\, low-power technique for residual splitting
def: "Cluster of pulses applied repeatedly for heteronuclear decoupling."
comment: "WALTZ is commonly used for proton decoupling during the acquisition of \(\ce{^{13}C}\) spectra."
synonym: "WALTZ decoupling" []
