[Term]
id: goldbook:08464
name: depth-profiling
def: "Process by which the sample is sputtered 'atomic layer by layer' using suitable conditions."
comment: "Depth profile analysis can be accomplished by time resolved measurement of the generated emission signals."
comment: "Depth profiling using signal versus time measurement requires knowledge of the ablation rate, which must be known, or has to be calculated, from measurements of suitable materials."
