consider: goldbook:08488
consider: goldbook:08490
consider: goldbook:08491

[Term]
id: goldbook:08490
name: inductively-coupled plasma mass spectrometry
def: "Measurement method of atomic spectrometry that uses an inductively-coupled plasma to excite and ionize atoms with measurement of the number and kind of ions in the plasma using mass spectrometry."
synonym: "ICP-MS" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2019-0203
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
