[Term]
id: goldbook:08607
name: free spectral range
def: "For a Fabry-Perot or laser cavity\, wavenumber interval between successive longitudinal cavity modes of vibration; \\\(\\Delta \\tilde\{ u\} = 1/\(2nl\)\\\)\, where \\\(l\\\) is the cavity spacing and \\\(n\\\) is the refractive index of the material in the cavity."
comment: "SI unit: \(\pu{m-1}\)."
