[Term]
id: goldbook:08610
name: harmonic constant
def: "Coefficient of \(\\\( u + &half;\\\)\) in the vibrational term value\, determined by the harmonic terms in the vibrational potential energy."
comment: "SI unit: \(\pu{m-1}\). Common unit: \(\pu{cm-1}\)."
