consider: goldbook:08302
consider: goldbook:08669

[Term]
id: goldbook:08669
name: Raman spectroscopy
def: "Measurement principle of vibrational spectroscopy based on Raman scattering."
comment: "Raman scattered light occurs at wavelengths that are shifted from the incident light by the energies of molecular vibrations."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2019-0203
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
consider: goldbook:08667
consider: goldbook:08708

[Term]
id: goldbook:08670
name: Raman spectrum
def: "Graph of the intensity of scattered electromagnetic radiation in Raman spectroscopy against Raman shift."
comment: "Commonly a Raman spectrum is obtained between approximately \(\pu{100 cm-1}\) and \(\pu{3500 cm-1}\) and is a complement to its counterpart mid-infrared spectrum."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2019-0203
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
consider: goldbook:08668
consider: goldbook:08669

[Term]
id: goldbook:08671
name: Raman wavenumber shift
def: "Wavenumber of exciting electromagnetic radiation minus wavenumber of the scattered radiation."
comment: "SI unit: \(\pu{m-1}\). Common unit: \(\pu{cm-1}\)."
comment: "\(\Delta \tilde{\nu}\) is positive for Stokes Raman scattering and negative for anti-Stokes Raman scattering."
synonym: "Raman shift" []
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2019-0203
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
