consider: goldbook:08605
consider: goldbook:08653

[Term]
id: goldbook:08673
name: reflection-absorption at grazing incidence
def: "Reflection-absorption with very thin layers of an absorbing material on a metallic substrate and the angle of incidence between \\\(\\pu\{70\\!^\{\\circ\}\}\\\) and \\\(\\pu\{90\\!^\{\\circ\}\}\\\)."
comment: "As the incident radiation beam travels nearly parallel to the sample surface, the electric vector of the radiation is then either parallel or nearly perpendicular to the surface."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2019-0203
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
