[Term]
id: goldbook:08777
name: charge carrier diffusion
def: "Purely random\, thermally induced motion of charge carriers."
comment: "According to the type of charge carriers undergoing diffusion, it is subdivided into electron diffusion, hole diffusion, polaron diffusion, soliton diffusion, etc."
