[Term]
id: goldbook:08779
name: charge carrier injection
def: "Process whereby charge carriers in excess of the thermodynamic equilibrium level are introduced into a conductor\, a semiconductor or an insulator from another material."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2020-0501
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
