[Term]
id: goldbook:08810
name: energy band
def: "Quasi-continuous range of discrete energy levels that an electron is either allowed \(an occupied band\) or forbidden \(forbidden band or band gap\) to occupy in a molecule or solid."
synonym: "electronic band" []
