name: homojunction
def: "Interface occurring between two similar semiconductors with equal bandgaps."
comment: "Homojunction mostly occurs at the interface between n-doped and p-doped semiconductor of the same nature, typically silicon. This type of homojunction is currently called a pn-junction."
