id: goldbook:08901
name: polythiadiazoles
def: "Polymers composed of macromolecules containing thiadiazole rings in the backbone \(structure-based polymer class name\)."
comment: "Poly(1,2,3-thiadiazole-4,5-diyl) and poly(1,3,4-thiadiazole-2,5-diyl) are conjugated polymers."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2020-0501
