id: goldbook:08907
name: activated-monomer polymerization
def: "Chain polymerization in which propagation involves reaction between a growing-chain end and an activated monomer."
comment: "The activator in activated-monomer polymerization should not be referred to as a catalyst unless it is established that it is a catalyst."
comment: "The activator in activated-monomer polymerization should not be referred to as a catalyst unless it is established that it is a catalyst."
