[Term]
id: goldbook:08943
name: chain deactivation
def: "Conversion of a chain carrier into an inactive species."
comment: "Chain deactivation, unlike chain termination, may be reversible."
comment: "The recommended symbol for the rate coefficient for chain deactivation in a polymerization is \(k_{\rm{deact}}\)."
comment: "The reverse of chain deactivation is chain activation or chain reactivation."
synonym: "deactivation" []
