[Term]
id: goldbook:08947
name: chain-transfer agent
def: "Substance able to react with a chain carrier by a reaction in which the original chain carrier is deactivated and a new chain carrier is generated."
comment: "In a polymerization, the common occurrence is that a new chain carrier of lower molar mass is generated."
synonym: "CTA" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
synonym: "transfer agent" []
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2020-1211
