def: "Coordination polymerization making use of a heterogeneous catalyst."
comment: "Heterogeneous catalysis coordination polymerization of polyolefins is sometimes known as Ziegler-Natta polymerization. Named reactions are deprecated in IUPAC terminology."
comment: "When using the term heterogeneous coordination polymerization, the context must allow distinction from a coordination polymerization in a heterogeneous medium."
