[Term]
id: goldbook:09037
name: cerimetric titration
def: "Redox titration using cerium\(IV\)\, in which an iron\(II\)-1\,10-phenanthroline complex \(ferroin\) color change indicates the end-point."
synonym: "cerimetry" []
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2023-0903
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string

[Term]
id: goldbook:09038
name: composite alkalinity
def: "Measurement by titration to the phenolphthalein end-point \(pH 8.3\) of that portion of alkalinity arbitrarily attributed to all the hydroxyl content and half the carbonate content of a titrand."
comment: "By definition, composite alkalinity is zero for solutions which have a pH value of 8.3 or less."
comment: "For the carbonate system, with no other oxoanions, \(A_{\rm{P}} = [\ce{CO3^{2-}}] + [\ce{OH-}]\) where the concentrations refer to the solution before the titration \(\ce{CO3^{2−} + H+ -> HCO3−}\) and \(\ce{OH− + H+ -> H2O}\) performed to discoloration of the visual indicator."
synonym: "phenolphthalein end-point alkalinity" []
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2023-0903
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
consider: goldbook:09034
consider: goldbook:09051

[Term]
id: goldbook:09039
name: conventional mass
def: "Mass of a body that is balanced by a standard mass under conventionally chosen conditions."
comment: "The International Organization of Legal Metrology recommends that the conventionally chosen conditions are: reference temperature, \(t_{\rm{ref}} = \pu{20^{\circ}C}\), density of air as a reference value, \(\rho_{0} = \pu{1.2 kg m−3}\); reference density of standard weight, \(\rho_{\rm{c}} = \pu{8000 kg m-3}\). In this case, the conventional mass is related to the mass (\(m\)) and density (\(\rho\)) of the object by \(m_{\rm{c}} = m \frac{1 - \rho_{0}/\rho}{1 - \rho_{0}/\rho_{\rm{c}}}\)"
comment: "The base unit of the quantity "conventional mass" is the kilogram."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2023-0903
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string

[Term]
id: goldbook:09040
name: direct titration
def: "Titration in which titrant is added directly to titrand."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2023-0903
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
consider: goldbook:09035
consider: goldbook:09051

[Term]
id: goldbook:09041
name: end-point error
def: "Difference in the volume or mass of titrant\, or the corresponding difference in the volume or mass of titrand\, between the end-point value and equivalence-point value."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2023-0903
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
