[Term]
id: goldbook:09071
name: electrochemical biosensor
def: "Electrochemical sensor that has a biological recognition element."
comment: "Electrochemical biosensor may be shortened to ‘biosensor’ only if there is no ambiguity concerning, or interest in, the principle of measurement."
