[Term]
id: goldbook:09122
name: potentiometric enzyme electrode
def: "Enzyme-modified electrode\, or an electrode modified by a substrate\, cofactor or inhibitor\, in which the activity of a product of the enzyme reaction is measured by an ion-selective electrode."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2018-0109
