consider: goldbook:09132
consider: goldbook:09156
consider: goldbook:09157
consider: goldbook:09159

[Term]
id: goldbook:09162
name: electrochemical piezoelectric microgravimetry
def: "Electrogravimetry using an electrochemical quartz crystal microbalance."
comment: "The change of mass is, for rigid deposits, linearly proportional to the change of the resonance frequency of the quartz crystal, according to the Sauerbrey equation. For non-rigid deposits, corrections must be made."
