id: goldbook:09629
name: semi-dendritic constitutional repeating unit
def: "Constitutional repeating unit of connectivity \\\(c \\ge 4\\\) connected to more than two but less than \\\(c\\\) other constitutional repeating units.Example of a hyperbranched macromolecule part with a semi-dendritic constitutional repeating unit of connectivity \\\(c = 4\\\) \(circled\)\, connected to three other constitutional repeating units and to one hydroxymethyl end-group. The preferred constitutional repeating unit is chosen such that the branch points are at its end in the dendron direction."
