[Term]
id: goldbook:09697
name: deoxyribonucleic acid fragmentation index
def: "Fraction of deoxyribonucleic acid \(DNA\) having fragmented DNA."
synonym: "DFI" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
synonym: "DNA fragmentation index" []
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2016-1120
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string

[Term]
id: goldbook:09698
name: deoxyribonucleic acid integrity index
def: "Ratio of longer fragments to shorter deoxyribonucleic acid \(DNA\)."
comment: "DNA strand integrity is measured by quantitative PCR (QPCR) using a real-time system."
comment: "Integrity index may be clinically usefully used as surrogate for detection of tumours."
synonym: "DNA integrity index" []
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2016-1120
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
