[Term]
id: goldbook:09822
name: glycoproteomics
def: "Comprehensive analysis of glycoproteins."
comment: "Glycoproteomics studies the glycosylated subset of the proteome, including sites of glycosylation and glycan structures."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2016-1120
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
consider: goldbook:09821
consider: goldbook:09827

[Term]
id: goldbook:09823
name: glycosidase
def: "Enzyme that catalyses the hydrolysis of glycosidic linkages."
comment: "Endoglycosidase hydrolyses internal glycosidic linkages, while exoglycosidase removes terminal monosaccharide from the non-reducing end of a glycoside."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2016-1120
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
consider: goldbook:09825

[Term]
id: goldbook:09824
name: glycoside
def: "Mixed acetal formally arising by the elimination of water between the hemiacetal or hemiketal hydroxy group of a sugar and a hydroxy group of a second compound. Glycan containing at least one glycosidic linkage to another glycan or an aglycon."
comment: "The bond between the two components is called a glycosidic bond."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2016-1120
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
consider: goldbook:09825
consider: goldbook:09829
consider: goldbook:09830

[Term]
id: goldbook:09825
name: glycosidic linkage
def: "Linkage of a monosaccharide to another residue via the anomeric hydroxy group."
synonym: "glycosidic bond" []
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2016-1120
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
consider: goldbook:09808

[Term]
id: goldbook:09826
name: glycosyl
def: "Monosaccharide ring without the anomeric oxygen."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2016-1120
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string

[Term]
id: goldbook:09827
name: glycosylation
def: "Covalent attachment of a saccharide to a protein\, lipid\, polynucleotide\, saccharide\, or other organic compound\, generally catalysed by enzymes glycosyltransferases."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2016-1120
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
