[Term]
id: goldbook:09985
name: examinand
def: "Nominal property intended to be examined."
comment: "The examined value may be obtained indirectly through examinations of other nominal properties, giving the examined value by using an algorithm which may involve measurement results and examination results."
comment: "The nominal property value of an examinand may be different from that of the property actually being examined due to changes of the system bearing the property during the examination."
