id: goldbook:10012
name: examination bias
def: "Estimate of a systematic examination error."
comment: "Examination bias is a quantity."
comment: "If the proportion distributions of the reference nominal property values and the examined values are the same, there is no examination bias for the examining system. If the distributions differ there is an examination bias."
comment: "In some publications on analytical chemistry, "examination bias" is termed "lack of reliability", but this is not recommended here."
