consider: goldbook:10038

[Term]
id: goldbook:10038
name: hold-up time
def: "Time required to elute a component which is not retained by the stationary phase."
comment: "The hold-up time includes any time that the component spends in the sample injector, the detector, and connectors."
comment: "The hold-up time is related to the hold-up volume (\(V_{\rm{M}}\)) and flow rate (\(F_{\rm{c}}\)) by \(t_{\rm{M}} = V_{\rm{M}}⁄F_{\rm{c}}\) ."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2017-0111
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string

[Term]
id: goldbook:10039
name: total retention time
def: "Time between sample injection and the emergence of the peak maximum of the sample component of interest."
comment: "The total retention time is related to the total retention volume (\(V_{\rm{R}}\)) and flow rate (\(F_{\rm{c}}\)) by \(t_{\rm{R}} = V_{\rm{R}}⁄F_{\rm{c}}\) ."
comment: "Total retention time includes the hold-up time."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2017-0111
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
consider: goldbook:10038

[Term]
id: goldbook:10040
name: retention time of an unretained compound
def: "Retention time of a sample component the molecules of which are larger than the largest pores of the particles of the stationary phase."
comment: "The retention time of an unretained compound is related to the retention volume of an unretained compound (in size-exclusion chromatography) and the flow rate (\(F_{\rm{c}}\)) by \(t_{0} = V_{0}/F_{\rm{c}}\) "
comment: "This component will be eluted first from the column."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2017-0111
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string

