consider: goldbook:10060
consider: goldbook:10100
consider: goldbook:10106
consider: goldbook:10155

[Term]
id: goldbook:10054
name: multiplicative scatter correction
def: "Data pre-processing in which a constant and a multiple of a reference data set is subtracted from data."
comment: "MSC is typically used in near-infrared spectrometry to remove effects of non-homogeneous particle size."
synonym: "MSC" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
synonym: "multiplicative signal correction" []
