[Term]
id: goldbook:10072
name: factor level
def: "Value of a factor in an experimental design."
comment: "A design may be designated by the number of levels chosen for each factor, as in "two-level design"."
comment: "When writing an experimental design the levels are usually coded."
synonym: "level" []
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1515/pac-2015-0605
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
