id: goldbook:10077
name: model
def: "Equation describing the response as a function of values of the factors."
comment: "The model can be based on knowledge of the chemistry or physics of the system, but usually the model is empirical, being linear or quadratic with interaction terms."
comment: "To obtain information about the significance of effects, data is usually mean centered and assessed against a coded experimental design."
