id: goldbook:10130
name: <em>k</em>-means clustering
def: "Unsupervised classification method which partitions objects into \\\(k\\\) groups\, in which each object belongs to the group with the nearest mean."
comment: "Although \(k\)-means clustering is called unsupervised classification the value of \(k\) may be specified."
