[Term]
id: goldbook:11407
name: area under the curve
def: "The area under a graph curve\, such as the number of actives identified by an algorithm as a function of the number of compounds tested\, commonly used as a  measure of the discriminating ability of an algorithm to correctly classify a test molecule."
