[Term]
id: goldbook:11408
name: autocorrelation vector
def: "A vector that describes a molecular structure in which each element corresponds to a distance \(number of bonds in a 2D structure or a binned interatomic  distance in a 3D structure\) between atoms of a particular type and the count of the number of times that distance is found in the structure."
