def: "Test for catalepsy in which a mouse is placed on a bar oriented parallel to and approximately \\\(\\pu\{2.5 cm\}\\\) off the ground. Typically\, if the mouse remains immobile on the bar for more than 20 seconds\, it is considered to be cataleptic."
comment: "The test can also be used for evaluating motor coordination."
