def: "Circular platform equipped with some 20 equidistant holes near the outer rim\, one of which is marked by visual cues and is an escape hole for a rodent that is placed near the middle of the platform and subjected to an adverse stimulus\, e.g.\, bright light."
comment: "Measured parameters include latency to escape, path length, number of errors, and velocity."
comment: "The test is used to evaluate cognitive deficits."
