property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string

[Term]
id: goldbook:12074
name: sick building syndrome
def: "Health effects or loss of a sense of well-being associated\, by those who experience it\, with time spent in a certain building or room."
comment: "Neurological symptoms include headache, irritability, and fatigue."
comment: "Potential causes include poor ventilation and indoor air quality, outgassing of volatile substances from building materials, molds, and ozone build-up from office machines. Psychological factors may play a role."
