[Term]
id: goldbook:12628
name: biological agent
def: "Biopolymer-based pharmaceutical\, such as a protein\, applicable to the prevention\, treatment\, or cure of diseases or injuries to man."
comment: "Biological agents may be any virus, therapeutic serum, toxin, antitoxin, vaccine, blood component or derivative, allergenic product, or analogous products."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/PAC-REC-12-11-23
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string

[Term]
id: goldbook:12629
name: blockbuster drug
def: "Drug that generates annual sales of USD 1 billion \(\\\(\\$\\pu\{E9\}\\\)\) or more."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/PAC-REC-12-11-23
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string

[Term]
id: goldbook:12630
name: carcinogen
def: "Agent \(chemical\, physical\, or biological\) that is capable of increasing the incidence of malignant neoplasms\, thus causing cancer."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/PAC-REC-12-11-23
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string

[Term]
id: goldbook:12631
name: chemical biology
def: "Application of chemistry to the study of molecular events in biological systems\, often using tool compounds."
comment: "Distinguished from medicinal chemistry, which is focused on the design and optimisation of compounds for specific molecular targets."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/PAC-REC-12-11-23
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
consider: goldbook:12684

[Term]
id: goldbook:12632
name: chemical database
def: "Specific electronic repository for storage and retrieval of chemical information."
comment: "A free database of chemical structures of small organic molecules and information on their biological activities is available from PubChem."
comment: "Chemical structural information is sometimes stored in string notation such as the InChI or SMILES notations."
comment: "Such databases can be searched to retrieve structural information and data on specific or related molecules."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/PAC-REC-12-11-23
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
