[Term]
id: goldbook:12651
name: effective concentration
def: "Concentration of a substance that produces a defined magnitude of response in a given system."
comment: "EC50 is the median dose that causes \(\pu{50\%}\) of the maximal response."
comment: "The term usually refers to an agonist in a receptor system effect and could represent either an increase or a decrease in a biological function."
synonym: "EC" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
