def: "Dose of a substance that causes a defined magnitude of response in a given system."
comment: "ED50 is the median dose that causes \(\pu{50\%}\) of the maximal response."
synonym: "ED" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/PAC-REC-12-11-23
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
