[Term]
id: goldbook:12787
name: melt flow index
def: "Mass of a polymer in grams that flows through a calibrated orifice at constant temperature under a specified load over a \\\(\\pu\{10\\!\{-\}min\}\\\) period."
comment: "Specified loads are mandated for specific polymers."
comment: "Standard procedures for determining MFI are available from ISO and ASTM."
comment: "The values of MFI as a function of load can give information on the molar mass distribution."
comment: "There is no suitable SI unit for MFI."
synonym: "MFI" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
synonym: "MFR" []
synonym: "melt flow rate" []
synonym: "melt mass flow rate" []
synonym: "melt volume flow" []
