comment: "The fusion protein encoded by BCR-ABL possesses unregulated tyrosine kinase activity."
comment: "The term ABL derives from the Abelson murine leukemia virus, from which the gene was first isolated."
comment: "This translocation creates the Philadelphia chromosome, found in most human patients with chronic myelogenous leukemia (CML)."
