[Term]
id: goldbook:12875
name: anergy
def: "Lack of an immune response\, usually taken as lack of response to common recall antigens."
comment: "The failure of B or T cells to proliferate in response to defined autoantigens (clonal anergy) is a primary mechanism of self-tolerance."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/PAC-REC-11-06-03
