name: celiac disease
def: "Autoimmune disorder occurring in genetically predisposed individuals\, characterized by immune intolerance to the \\\(\\ce\{\\upalpha\\mbox\{-\}gliadin\}\\\) component of gluten\, a protein found in wheat\, barley\, and rye. Resultant inflammation of the mucosa of the upper small intestine is associated with malabsorption of nutrients and a wasting illness follows from this."
