[Term]
id: goldbook:13007
name: chronic lymphocytic leukemia
def: "B cell tumor found in the blood."
comment: "The great majority of these tumors express CD5 and unmutated variable (V) genes and are therefore thought to arise from B-1 cells."
synonym: "CLL" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/PAC-REC-11-06-03
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
