[Term]
id: goldbook:13014
name: clonal expansion
def: "Proliferation of B lymphocytes and T lymphocytes activated by clonal selection in order to produce a clone of identical cells."
comment: "Clonal expansion enables the body to have sufficient numbers of antigen-specific lymphocytes to mount an effective immune response."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/PAC-REC-11-06-03
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
