[Term]
id: goldbook:13032
name: complement receptor
def: "Cell-surface protein that recognizes and binds complement proteins that have bound an antigen."
comment: "Complement receptors on phagocytes allow them to identify pathogens coated with complement proteins for uptake and destruction. Complement receptors include CR1, CR2, CR3, CR4, and the receptor for Clq."
synonym: "CR" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
