[Term]
id: goldbook:13089
name: dermatitis
def: "Inflammation of the skin showing redness\, swelling\, infiltration\, scaling\, and sometimes vesicles and blisters\: contact dermatitis is due to local exposure and may be caused by irritation\, allergy\, or photocontact dermatitis."
