[Term]
id: goldbook:13090
name: dermatomyositis
def: "Disease characterized by the presence of inflammation of the skin and muscles."
comment: "Its cause is unknown, but it may be associated with a viral infection or some autoimmune reaction and may present also as paraneoplastic phenomena (see paraneoplastic autoimmune syndrome)."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/PAC-REC-11-06-03
