def: "Most frequent antibody-mediated drug-induced thrombocytopenia\, which occurs in \\\(\\pu\{1-\}\\pu\{2\\%\}\\\) of patients treated with heparin intravenously for longer than four days."
comment: "This disease is mediated by antibodies to complexes formed between heparin and the endogenous platelet factor 4 (PF4)."
