def: "Clinical name for a genetic deficiency of the C1 inhibitor of the complement system."
comment: "In the absence of C1 inhibitor, spontaneous activation of the complement system can cause diffuse fluid leakage from blood vessels, the most serious consequence of which is epiglottal swelling leading to suffocation."
