id: goldbook:13238
name: hyperimmunoglobulin E syndrome
def: "Rare primary immunodeficiency syndrome characterized by recurrent severe staphylococcal skin abscesses \(hence Job syndrome\)\, lung infections\, and markedly elevated serum immunoglobulin E \(IgE\) levels."
synonym: "Job syndrome" []
