[Term]
id: goldbook:13297
name: immunological ignorance
def: "Absence of a pathogenic autoimmune response in spite of the concomitant presence in the host of the autoantigen and T cells bearing the specific autoreactive T-cell receptor \(TCR\)."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/PAC-REC-11-06-03
