comment: "Immunotherapy is largely an experimental approach, applied most widely in the treatment of leukemias, melanoma, and hypernephroma."
comment: "Immunotherapy may involve active or passive immunization, immunopotentiation or immunosuppression, hyposensitization, bone marrow transplantation, or thymus implantation."
