comment: "Stimulation of the B cell and subsequent antibody production takes place after the ICOS receptor attaches to its partner B7RP-1 molecule. Thus, the co-stimulatory molecules, ICOS and B7H/B7RP-1, provide specificity for the immune system activation process."
synonym: "ICOS" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
