comment: "There appear to be at least three types of inflammasomes. Those identified initially were the NALP1 inflammasome, the NALP3 (cryopyrin) inflammasome, and the interleukin-(IL-)1β converting enzyme (ICE) protease-activating factor (IPAF) inflammasome."
