id: goldbook:13480
name: murine local lymph node assay
def: "Predictive test of sensitization in which a test substance is applied topically to the skin of mice \(usually three times at daily intervals\) and the weight of the local draining lymph nodes is measured at six days. Usually lymphoproliferation in the nodes is measured following injection of \[\\\(\\ce\{^\{3\}H\}\\\)\]thymidine or bromodeoxyuridine."
synonym: "LLNA" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
