comment: "The director also coincides with a local symmetry axis of any directional property of the mesophase, such as the refractive index or magnetic susceptibility."
comment: "The director is defined as a unit vector, but directions \(\boldsymbol{+n}\) and \(\boldsymbol{-n}\) are arbitrary."
