comment: "Rotaxane constitutional unit(s) may be located within a specific part of a macromolecular rotaxane: (i) within end-group(s); (ii) within a main chain (see main-chain macromolecular rotaxane); (iii) within side chains (see side-chain macromolecular rotaxane)."
