[Term]
id: goldbook:14648
name: environmental security
def: "United Nations concept\, defined as the relative stability of Earth’s natural ecosystems against human activity\, most notably  global climate change caused by human release of greenhouse gas; deforestation caused by so-called 'clearing' of lands; or soil depletion and desertification caused by intensive monoculture techniques."
