def: "Hypothesis that bioavailability is governed by the diffusion of the unionized form of an ionizable substance through the gastrointestinal lumen\, as determined by \\\(\\pu\{p\}K_\{\\rm\{a\}\}\\\) and \\\(\\rm\{pH\}\\\)."
