[Term]
id: goldbook:15214
name: multicompartment formulation
def: "Dosage form \(capsule\, tablet\) comprising several elements \(e.g.\, microspheres or coated pellets\) differing in the rate of drug release."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/PAC-REC-04-10-14
