name: polyvinyl ester
def: "Polymer prepared from a vinyl ester."
comment: "A molecule of a regular polyvinyl ester is described by the constitutional repeating unit:  where \(\ce{R}\) is alkyl, aryl, or heteroaryl or substituted alkyl, substituted aryl, or substituted heteroaryl."
comment: "Polyvinyl esters are a subclass of vinyl polymers."
