def: "Polymer composed of macromolecules containing 1\,3\,5-triazine-2\,4\,6-triyltrioxy constitutional units \(formerly cyanurate groups\) in the backbone\:"
comment: "Cyanurate is not an IUPAC approved name for 1,3,5-triazinetris(olate)."
comment: "Polycyanurates are isomeric with polyisocyanurates."
comment: "Polycyanurates can be regarded as a subclass of polytriazines."
