comment: "The ideal value of the \(\ce{O{:}Si}\) ratio of \(1.5{:}1\) is achieved only in the case of a ladder polymer. For hyperbranched polysilsesquioxanes, the value of the \(\ce{O{:}Si}\) ratio is higher."
