def: "For a mixture\, temperature and pressure \(the azeotropic temperature and pressure\) at which the compositions of the liquid and vapor phases become equal \(the azeotropic composition\)\, but the intensive properties of the two phases \(such as molar volume\) are different."
synonym: "azeotrope" []
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac200880020233
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
