[Term]
id: goldbook:15342
name: mutual solubility
def: "In a system of two or more liquid or solid components\, solubility of all components in all phases."
comment: "If mutual solubility is limited over a range of temperature and composition, the liquids or solids are said to exhibit partial miscibility and the system possesses a miscibility gap."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac200880020233
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
