def: "n.\, Substance inhibiting or preventing the actions of nicotine and nicotine-like agents \(e.g.\, suxamethonium chloride\) on the nicotinic acetylcholine receptors. adj.\, Inhibiting or preventing the actions of nicotine and nicotine-like agents on the nicotinic acetylcholine receptors."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac200779071153
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string

[Term]
id: goldbook:15467
