def: "Insoluble iron\(III\) hydroxide-based pigment deposited in cells in conditions of iron overload."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac200779071153
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string

[Term]
id: goldbook:15772
name: hepatic
def: "Pertaining to the liver."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac200779071153
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string

[Term]
id: goldbook:15773
name: hepatotoxic
def: "Poisonous to liver cells."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac200779071153
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string

[Term]
id: goldbook:15774
name: herbicide
def: "Substance intended to kill plants."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac200779071153
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string

[Term]
id: goldbook:15775
name: heterozygote
def: "Organism that has different allelic forms of a specified gene on each of a pair of homologous chromosomes or describing the genome of that organism."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac200779071153
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string

[Term]
id: goldbook:15776
name: Hill plot
def: "Graphical method for analyzing binding of a molecule \\\(\\ce\{A\}\\\) to a macromolecule \\\(\\ce\{P\}\\\) with \\\(n\\\) binding sites. A Hill plot of \\\(\\log\[\\theta/\(1 - \\theta\)\]\\\) vs. \\\(\\log\[\\ce\{A\}\]\\\) has a slope of 1 if binding is noncooperative and \\\(\\gt 1\\\) for cooperative binding\, where \\\(\\theta = \[\\ce\{A\}\]_\{\\rm\{bound\}\}/n\[\\ce\{P\}\]_\{\\rm\{total\}\}\\\) is the fraction of sites occupied."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac200779071153
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string

[Term]
id: goldbook:15777
name: histogenic origin
def: "Germ cell layer of the embryo from which a given adult tissue develops."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac200779071153
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string

[Term]
id: goldbook:15778
name: histology
def: "Study \(usually microscopic\) of the anatomy of tissues and their cellular and subcellular structure."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac200779071153
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string

[Term]
id: goldbook:15779
name: histopathology
def: "Microscopic pathological study of the anatomy and cell structure of tissues in disease to reveal abnormal or adverse structural changes."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac200779071153
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string

[Term]
id: goldbook:15780
