[Term]
id: goldbook:A00312
name: AM 0 sunlight
def: "Solar irradiance in space just above the atmosphere of the earth on a plane perpendicular to the direction of the sun \(air mass\, AM\, zero\). Also called extraterrestrial irradiance."
