[Term]
id: goldbook:A00423
name: appearance temperature
def: "The temperature of the atomization surface at which the analyte signal/noise \(S/N\) ratio reaches a value of 3 when the quantity of analyte in the atomizer is one hundred times the characteristic mass for peak high absorption."
