def: "A mechanism that sometimes applies to the combination of atoms\, but rarely of free radicals. In this mechanism the atom A first combines with a third body or chaperon\, $$\\ce\{A + M -> AM\}$$ and the complex AM then forms $\\ce\{A2 + M\}$ by collision with another atom $\\ce\{A\}$. Contrast the energy-transfer mechanism."
