[Term]
id: goldbook:A00555
name: azides
def: "Compounds bearing the group $\\ce\{N3\}$\, viz. $\\ce\{–N=N^\{+\}=N^\{-\}\}$; usually attached to carbon\, e.g. $\\ce\{PhN3\}$ phenyl azide or azidobenzene.Salts of hydrazoic acid\, $\\ce\{HN3\}$\, e.g. $\\ce\{NaN3\}$ sodium azide."
