id: goldbook:B00615
name: batch operation
def: "The operation of an analytical instrument in such a way that one or more analytical procedures must be completed for a sequence of samples before the next sequence can be started. This term batch usually implies a sequence of a variably sized group of samples\, the size of which is not related to a particular type of instrument."
