id: goldbook:B00618
name: bathochromic shift
def: "Shift of a spectral band to lower frequencies \(longer wavelengths\) owing to the influence of substitution or a change in environment. It is informally referred to as a red shift and is opposite to hypsochromic shift \(blue shift\)."
