[Term]
id: goldbook:B00758
name: Bunnett–Olsen equations
def: "The equations for the relation between \\\(\\log _\{10\}\(\\frac\{\\rm\{\[SH\}^\{+\}\\rm\{\]\}\}\{\[S\]\}\)+\\rm\{H\}_\{0\}\\\) and \\\(\\log _\{10\}\\rm\{\[H\}^\{+\}\\rm\{\]\}+\\rm\{H\}_\{0\}\\\) for base S in aqueous mineral acid solution\, where \\\(\\rm\{H\}_\{0\}\\\) is Hammett's acidity function and \\\(\\log _\{10\}\\rm\{\[H\}^\{+\}\\rm\{\]\}+\\rm\{H\}_\{0\}\\\) represents the activity function \\\(\\frac\{\\log _\{10\}\(\\gamma _\{S\}\\ \\gamma _\{H^\{+\}\}\)\}\{\\gamma _\{\\rm\{SH\}^\{+\}\}\}\\\) for the nitroaniline reference bases to build \\\(\\rm\{H\}_\{0\}\\\). \\\[\\log _\{10\}\(\\frac\{\[\\rm\{SH\}^\{+\}\]\}\{\[\\rm\{S\}\]\}\)- \\log _\{10\}\[\\rm\{H\}^\{+\}\]=\(\\varPhi - 1\)\\ \(\\log _\{10\}\\rm\{\[H\}^\{+\}\\rm\{\]\}+\\rm\{H\}_\{0\}\)+pK_\{\\rm\{SH\}^\{+\}\}\\\] \\\[\\log _\{10\}\(\\frac\{\[\\rm\{SH\}^\{+\}\]\}\{\[\\rm\{S\}\]\}\)+H_\{0\}=\\varPhi \\ \(\\log _\{10\}\[\\rm\{H\}^\{+\}\]+\\rm\{H\}_\{0\}\)+pK_\{\\rm\{SH\}^\{+\}\}\\\]"
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac199466051077
