def: "Polymer susceptible to degradation by biological activity\, with the degradation accompanied by a lowering of its molar mass."
comment: "In the case of a polymer, its biodegradation proceeds not only by catalytic activity of enzymes, but also by a wide variety of biological activities."
comment: "See also Note 2 to polymer degradation."
