[Term]
id: goldbook:C00784
name: calorie
def: "Non-SI unit of energy. There are three differently defined calories\: thermochemical calorie \(\\\(\\rm\{cal\}_\{\\rm\{th\}\} = 4.184\\ \\rm\{J\}\\\)\)\, international steam table calorie \(\\\(\\rm\{cal\}_\{\\rm\{IT\}\} = 4.1868\\ \\rm\{J\}\\\)\)\, \\\(15\\ ^\{\\\,\\unicode\{x26ac\}\}\\rm\{C\}\\\) calorie \(\\\(\\rm\{cal\}_\{15\} = 4.1855\\ \\rm\{J\}\\\)\)\, however only the symbol \\\(\\rm\{cal\}\\\) is usually used."
