def: "Catalytic activity of the component divided by the volume of the system."
comment: "In clinical chemistry litre is recommended as unit for the volume."
comment: "In clinical chemistry the component is usually an enzyme."
comment: "In describing a quantity, concentration must be clearly differentiated from content."
comment: "The term 'catalytic concentration' is accepted for use in clinical chemistry."
comment: "Use of the term level as a synonym for concentration is deprecated."
synonym: "catalytic concentration" []
