[Term]
id: goldbook:C00973
name: chaperon
def: "A species that facilitates a combination reaction between atoms or radicals\, or the reverse process\, is known as a chaperon. It is a special case of a third body."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac199668010149
