[Term]
id: goldbook:C00994
name: charge number
def: "The magnitude of the charge on an ion\, given in arabic numerals followed by the sign of the charge\, in parentheses without a space\, immediately after the name of an ion\, e.g. iron\(2+\)\, hexacyanoferrate\(4−\)."
