def: "Obtained after correcting for instrumental and sample effects and usually represented by a graph of \\\(\\mathit\{\\Phi\} _\{\\lambda\}\\\) against wavelength\, where \\\(\\mathit\{\\Phi\} _\{\\lambda\}\\\) is the spectral \(radiant\) energy flux."
