[Term]
id: goldbook:CT06937
name: convex isotherm
def: "Distribution isotherm\, the slope of which is continuously decreasing."
comment: "The resulting chromatographic peak is tailing. Adsorption isotherms are often of this type. A special case is the Langmuir adsorption isotherm."
