[Term]
id: goldbook:CT06955
name: computer-assisted molecular modeling
def: "Computer-assisted molecular modeling is the investigation of molecular structures and properties using computational chemistry and graphical visualization techniques."
synonym: "CAMM" RELATED OMO:0003012 []
