consider: goldbook:E02257
consider: goldbook:MT07075

[Term]
id: goldbook:CT07344
name: complete active space self-consistent field second-order perturbation theory
def: "Theoretical scheme suitable for computations of accurate excitation energies and reaction barriers. In the first step\, electron correlation is taken into account only to a certain extent by using a CASSCF formalism \(the so called non-dynamic correlation\)\, whereas the remaining electron correlation \(the so called dynamic correlation\) is included through the use of second-order perturbation theory."
synonym: "CASPT2" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac200779030293
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
