[Term]
id: goldbook:D01843
name: double escape peak
def: "In a gamma-ray spectrum\, the peak due to pair production in the detector and escape\, from the sensitive part of the detector\, of two photons of \\\(511\\ \\rm\{keV\}\\\) resulting from annihilation."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac198254081533
