id: goldbook:D01874
name: dynamic range
def: "The ratio between the maximum usable indication and the minimum usable indication \(detection limit\). A distinction may be made between the linear dynamic range\, where the response is directly proportional to concentration\, and the dynamic range where the response may be non-linear\, especially at higher concentrations."
