[Term]
id: goldbook:DT07018
name: degenerate orbitals
def: "Orbitals whose energy levels are equal in the absence of external fields. Any linear combination of the functions corresponding to a given set of degenerate orbitals serves as an equivalent representation of this set of orbitals."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac199971101919
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string

[Term]
id: goldbook:DT07019
name: delocalization
def: "Redistribution of the valence-shell electron density throughout a molecular entity as compared with some localized models \(individual atoms in their valence states\, separated bonds or fragments\). Different topological modes of the electron delocalization include\: ribbon delocalization of either $\\ce\{\\uppi\\!\\mbox\{-\}\}$ or $\\ce\{\\upsigma\\!\\mbox\{-\}electrons\}$ \(i.e.\, electrons occupying respectively $\\ce\{\\uppi\\!\\mbox\{-\}\}$ and $\\ce\{\\upsigma\\!\\mbox\{-\}orbitals\}$\)surface delocalization of $\\ce\{\\upsigma\\!\\mbox\{-\}electrons\}$ occurring through an overlap of radially oriented $\\ce\{\\upsigma\\!\\mbox\{-\}orbitals\}$ of a cyclic molecule\, as is the case of cyclopropane; andvolume delocalization of $\\ce\{\\upsigma\\!\\mbox\{-\}electrons\}$ through an overlap of $\\ce\{\\upsigma\\!\\mbox\{-\}orbitals\}$ directed inside a molecular polyhedron\, as is the case in tetrahedrane."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac199971101919
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
consider: goldbook:D01583
consider: goldbook:E01986
consider: goldbook:V06588

[Term]
id: goldbook:DT07020
name: delocalization energy
def: "The difference between the actual $\\ce\{\\uppi\\!\\mbox\{-\}electron\}$ energy of a molecular entity and the $\\ce\{\\uppi\\!\\mbox\{-\}electron\}$ energy of a hypothetical species with a localized form of the $\\ce\{\\uppi\\!\\mbox\{-\}electron\}$ system. These energies are normally evaluated within Hückel molecular orbital theory."
synonym: "DE" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac199971101919
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
