[Term]
id: goldbook:E01901
name: effector
def: "A small molecule which increases \(activator\) or decreases \(inhibitor\) the activity of an \(allosteric\) protein by binding to the protein at the regulatory site \(which is different from the substrate-binding catalytic site\)."
