consider: goldbook:O04362
consider: goldbook:R05222

[Term]
id: goldbook:E01980
name: electron capture
def: "A nuclear transformation in which the nucleus captures an orbital electron. Often the shell\, from which the electron is captured\, is indicated. \(K-\, L-\, etc.\)."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac198254081533
