consider: goldbook:F02341
consider: goldbook:K03402

[Term]
id: goldbook:E02017
name: electro-osmotic pressure
def: "The pressure difference \\\(\\Delta p\\\) across the membrane\, plug\, etc.\, needed just to stop electro-osmotic volume flow. \\\(\\Delta p\\\) is positive if the higher pressure is on the high potential side."
