[Term]
id: goldbook:E02221
name: ethers
def: "Compounds ROR \($\\ce\{R\}  eq \\ce\{H\}$\). \(Compounds $\\ce\{R3SiOR\}$\, silicon analogues of ethers\, are trialkylsilyloxy compounds\). E.g. $\\ce\{CH3CH2OCH2CH3\}$ ."
