[Term]
id: goldbook:E02243
name: excimer laser
def: "A source of pulsed coherent radiation obtained from an exciplex. The proper name is exciplex laser. Typical lasing species are noble gas halides \($\\ce\{XeCl\}$\, $\\ce\{KrF\}$\, etc.\) emitting in the UV domain."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac199567111913
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac199668122223
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
