[Term]
id: goldbook:E02244
name: excimer-luminescence
def: "An effect accompanying concentration quenching in some cases\, namely the formation of a new bimolecular species which is capable of emission \(excimer- and exciplex-luminescence\)."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac198456020231
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
consider: goldbook:E02242
consider: goldbook:E02246
consider: goldbook:L03641
consider: goldbook:M03989
