name: flavins
def: "Derivatives of the dimethylisoalloxazine \(7\,8-dimethylbenzo\[g\]pteridine- 2\,4\(3H\,10H\)-dione\) skeleton\, with a substituent on the 10 position. \(Riboflavin\, having a 10-ᴅ-ribityl group\, is the most prominent member\)."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac199567081307
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string

[Term]
id: goldbook:F02424
name: flavonoids
def: "Flavonoids\, isoflavonoids and neoflavonoids are natural products derived from 2-phenylchromen-4-one \(flavone\)\, 3-phenylchromen-4-one and 4-phenylcoumarin\, respectively. Derivations include reduction of the 2\(3\) carbon-carbon double bond \(flavanones\)\, reduction of the keto group \(flavanols\)\, and hydroxylation at various positions."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac199567081307
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
