id: goldbook:F02444
name: flow resistance parameter
def: "A term used to compare packing density and permeability of columns packed with different particles; it is dimensionless. \\\[\\mathit\{\\Phi\} = \\frac\{d_\{\\rm\{p\}\}^\{2\}\}\{B_\{0\}\}\\\] where \\\(d_\{\\rm\{p\}\}\\\) is the average particle diameter. In open-tubular columns \\\(\\mathit\{\\Phi\} = 32\\\)."
