[Term]
id: goldbook:F02453
name: fluorescence
def: "Luminescence which occurs essentially only during the irradiation of a substance by electromagnetic radiation."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac198456020231
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac199466122513
