id: goldbook:FT07550
name: fractal dimension
def: "Parameter that provides a mathematical description of the fractal structure of a polymer network\, an aggregated particulate sol\, or of the particles that comprise them."
comment: "For a Euclidean object of constant density, \(d = 3\), but for a fractal object, \(d"
comment: "For the surface area of a fractal object, \(s \propto r^{d'}\) in which \(s\) is the surface area contained within a radius, \(r\), measured from any site or bond and \(d'\) is termed the surface fractal dimension."
comment: "\(m \propto r^{d}\) in which \(m\) is the mass contained within a radius, \(r\), measured from any site or bond within a fractal structure."
synonym: "Hausdorff dimension" []
synonym: "mass fractal dimension" []
