id: goldbook:G02634
name: Gibbs film elasticity
def: "Pertains to a film element of a soap film changing in area at constant mass and is the differential change of its surface tension with relative change in area \\\(A\\\)\, \\\[E=A\\ \(\\frac\{\\partial \\sigma \}\{\\partial A\}\)_\{T\,p\,n_\{i\}\}\\\] where \\\(T\\\) is the thermodynamic temperature\, \\\(p\\\) is the pressure\, and \\\(n_\{i\}\\\) is the amount of substance of the species \\\(i\\\)."
