def: "\[obsolete\] Association between a base and its conjugate acid through a hydrogen bond \($\\ce\{B\\bond\{...\}HB^\{+\}\}$ or $\\ce\{AH\\bond\{...\}A^\{-\}\}$\). Homoassociation is a more appropriate term for this phenomenon.The orbital overlap of two $\\ce\{\\uppi\\!\\mbox\{-\}systems\}$ separated by a non-conjugating group\, such as $\\ce\{CH2\}$."
