def: "A process in which a solid or liquid\, $\\ce\{\\upbeta\\!\}$\, is covered with a liquid\, $\\ce\{\\upalpha\\!\}$\, both of which were initially in contact with a gas or liquid\, $\\ce\{\\updelta\\!\}$\, without changing the area of the $\\ce\{\\upalpha\\!\\updelta\\!\\mbox\{-\}\}$interface."
