[Term]
id: goldbook:I02977
name: immune response
def: "Selective reaction of the body to substances that are foreign to it\, or that the immune system identifies as foreign\, shown by the production of antibodies and antibody-bearing cells or by a cell-mediated hypersensitivity reaction."
