[Term]
id: goldbook:I02991
name: imprecision
def: "Variation of the result in a set of replicate measurements. This can be expressed\, e.g. as the standard deviation or coefficient of variation \(relative standard deviation\). This term may have a more general meaning\, e.g. if the replicates constitute a batch or involve different instruments\, laboratories and analyst."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac198961091657
