[Term]
id: goldbook:M03694
name: main chain
def: "That linear chain to which all other chains\, long or short or both\, may be regarded as being pendant."
comment: "Where two or more chains could equally be considered to be the main chain, that one is selected which leads to the simplest representation of the molecule."
synonym: "backbone" []
