[Term]
id: goldbook:M03711
name: mass-average velocity
def: "Mass-average velocity\: \\\[ u_\{b\} = \\rho ^\{-1\}\\ \\sum C_\{i\}M_\{i\} u_\{i\}\\\] Cf. molar average velocity\: \\\[ u_\{m\} = c_\{t\}^\{-1\}\\ \\sum c_\{i\} u_\{i\}\\\] with \\\(c_\{t\}=\\sum c_\{i\}\\\) where \\\(M_\{i\}\\\) = molar mass\, \\\(c_\{t\}\\\) = total concentration \(\\\(\\pu\{mol m-1\}\\\)\)\, \\\(\\rho \\\) = density of the solution \(\\\(\\pu\{kg m-3\}\\\)\)."
