[Term]
id: goldbook:M03965
name: modifier
def: "A substance added to a solvent to improve its properties e.g. by increasing the solubility of an extractant\, changing interfacial parameters or reducing adsorption losses. Additives used to enhance extraction rates should be called accelerators or catalysts."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac199365112373
