[Term]
id: goldbook:NT07427
name: Norrish–Yang reaction
def: "Photochemical process leading to the formation of cyclobutanols from excited carbonyl compounds by intramolecular $\\ce\{\\upgamma\\!\\mbox\{-\}hydrogen\}$ abstraction \(Norrish Type II photoreaction\) and subsequent 1\,4-diradical combination."
