[Term]
id: goldbook:O04314
name: optical spectroscopy
def: "The study of systems by the electromagnetic radiation with which they interact or that they produce. By convention\, spectroscopic properties are expressed in terms of wavelength in vacuo\, not the wavelength within the medium being studied."
