[Term]
id: goldbook:P04693
name: plate height
def: "The column length \(\\\(L\\\)\) divided by the plate number\: \\\[H=\\frac\{L\}\{N\}\\\] It is also called the height equivalent to one theoretical plate \(HETP\)."
