[Term]
id: goldbook:P04819
name: pressure
def: "Normal force acting on a surface divided by the area of that surface. For a mixture of gases the contribution by each constituent is called the 'partial pressure' \\\(p_\{i\} = x_\{i\} p\\\)\, where \\\(x_\{i\}\\\) is the amount fraction of the \\\(i\\\)th constituent and \\\(p\\\) is the total pressure."
