[Term]
id: goldbook:PT07441
name: parametric processes
def: "Interaction of photons in a non-linear medium satisfying the energy and momentum conservation laws. During the interaction the photon frequencies are mixed and photon\(s\) with different frequencies are created."
comment: "Optical parametric processes of three interacting beams, called frequency mixing processes, are: second-harmonic generation (SHG), sum-frequency generation (SFG), difference-frequency generation (DFG), optical parametric generation and amplification (OPG and OPA), and optical parametric oscillation (OPO)."
synonym: "optical parametric processes" []
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac200779030293
