consider: goldbook:S05747

[Term]
id: goldbook:PT07459
name: photon number
def: "Total number of photons calculated as \\\(N_\{\\rm\{p\}\} = n_\{\\rm\{p\}\}\\\, N_\{\\rm\{A\}\}\\\) with \\\(N_\{\\rm\{p\}\}\\\) the amount of photons in einsteins and \\\(N_\{\\rm\{A\}\}\\\) the Avogadro constant."
comment: "Mathematical definition: \(N_{\rm{p}} = Q/h\nu\) for monochromatic radiation of frequency \(\nu\), with \(Q\) the radiant energy."
