[Term]
id: goldbook:Q04975
name: quality assurance
def: "The guarantee that the quality of a product \(analytical data set\, etc.\) is actually what is claimed on the basis of the quality control applied in creating that product. Quality assurance is not synonymous with quality control. Quality assurance is meant to protect against failures of quality control."
