[Term]
id: goldbook:Q04981
name: quantitative structure–activity relationships
def: "The building of structure–biological activity models by using regression analysis with physicochemical constants\, indicator variables or theoretical calculations. The term has been extended by some authors to include chemical reactivity\, i.e. activity is regarded as synonymous with reactivity. This extension is\, however\, discouraged."
