consider: goldbook:R05174

[Term]
id: goldbook:R05176
name: reaction probability
def: "The probability that a reaction occurs when two particles undergo a collision. If \\\(N_\{\\rm\{c\}\}\\\) is the number of collisions occurring in unit time\, and \\\(N_\{\\rm\{r\}\}\\\) the number of reactions occurring in unit time\: \\\(P_\{\\rm\{r\}\}=\\frac\{N_\{\\rm\{r\}\}\}\{N_\{\\rm\{c\}\}\}\\\)."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac199668010149
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
consider: goldbook:P04855

[Term]
id: goldbook:R05177
name: reaction stage
def: "A set of one or more \(possibly experimentally inseparable\) reaction steps leading to and/or from a detectable or presumed reaction intermediate."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac199466051077
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
consider: goldbook:I03096
consider: goldbook:R05178

[Term]
id: goldbook:R05178
name: reaction step
def: "An elementary reaction\, constituting one of the stages of a stepwise reaction in which a reaction intermediate \(or\, for the first step\, the reactants\) is converted into the next reaction intermediate \(or\, for the last step\, the products\) in the sequence of intermediates between reactants and products."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac199466051077
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
consider: goldbook:E02035
