[Term]
id: goldbook:R05206
name: recovery
def: "In toxicology\, the process leading to partial or complete restoration of a cell\, tissue\, organ or organism following its damage from exposure to a harmful substance or agent.Term used in analytical and preparative chemistry to denote the fraction of the total quantity of a substance recoverable following a chemical procedure."
