[Term]
id: goldbook:R05308
name: <i>Re</i>\, <i>Si</i>
def: "A stereoheterotopic face of a trigonal atom is designated Re if the ligands of the trigonal atom appear in a clockwise sense in order of CIP priority when viewed from that side of the face. The opposite arrangement is termed Si."
synonym: "CIP" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
