id: goldbook:R05352
name: retardation factor
def: "The fraction of the sample component in the mobile phase at equilibrium; it is related to the retention factor and other fundamental chromatography terms\: \\\[R = \\frac\{1\}\{k\\\,+\\\,1\}\\\]"
