id: goldbook:R05412
name: rotational frequency
def: "The number of rotations divided by time\: \\\[f_\{\\rm\{rot\}\}=\\frac\{\\rm\{d\}N\}\{\\rm\{d\}t\}\\\] The synonyms rate of rotation\, rate of revolution\, centrifugal speed\, centrifugation speed\, and the traditional units of rotational frequency such as revolutions per minute\, r.p.m.\, ppm\, \\\(\\rm\{rev min\}^\{-1\}\\\)\, \\\(\\rm\{r min\}^\{-1\}\\\)\, are not recommended."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac199466040897
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac199668040957
