consider: goldbook:M03749
consider: goldbook:MT06831

[Term]
id: goldbook:S05548
name: selection
def: "A laboratory method applying a mixture of microorganisms to particular growth conditions under which only the cells with particular characteristics can survive and may be isolated."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac199264010143
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string

[Term]
id: goldbook:S05549
name: selection rule
def: "A rule that states whether a given transition is allowed or forbidden\, on the basis of the symmetry or spin of the wavefunctions of the initial and final states."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac199668122223
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string

[Term]
id: goldbook:S05550
name: selective
def: "A term which expresses qualitatively the extent to which other substances interfere with the determination of a substance according to a given procedure."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac198855030553
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string

[Term]
id: goldbook:S05551
name: selective corrosion
def: "Corrosion of a single phase having more than one component\, when the ratio of the corrosion rates of the components differs from the ratio of bulk mole fractions. Selective corrosion changes the composition of the material in the interfacial region."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac198961010019
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
consider: goldbook:C01351
consider: goldbook:I03087
consider: goldbook:M03980

[Term]
id: goldbook:S05556
name: selectively labelled
def: "An isotopically labelled compound is designated as selectively labelled when a mixture of isotopically substituted compounds is formally added to the analogous isotopically unmodified compound in such a way that the position\(s\) but not necessarily the number of each labelling nuclide is defined. A selectively labelled compound may be considered as a mixture of specifically labelled compounds."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac198153101887
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
consider: goldbook:I03336
