[Term]
id: goldbook:S06036
name: STP
def: "Abbreviation for standard temperature \(\\\(273.15\\ \\rm\{K\}\\\) or \\\(0\\ ^\{\\\,\\unicode\{x26ac\}\}\\rm\{C\}\\\)\) and pressure \(\\\(10^\{5\}\\ \\rm\{Pa\}\\\)\); usually employed in reporting gas volumes. Note that flow meters calibrated in standard gas volumes per unit time often refer to volumes at \\\(25\\ ^\{\\\,\\unicode\{x26ac\}\}\\rm\{C\}\\\)\, not \\\(0\\ ^\{\\\,\\unicode\{x26ac\}\}\\rm\{C\}\\\)."
synonym: "STP" RELATED OMO:0003000 []
