[Term]
id: goldbook:S06059
name: strong collision
def: "A collision between two molecules in which the amount of energy transferred from one to the other is large compared with \\\(k_\{\\rm\{B\}\}\\ T\\\)\, where \\\(k_\{\\rm\{B\}\}\\\) is the Boltzmann constant and \\\(T\\\) the absolute temperature."
