id: goldbook:S06062
name: structural transition
def: "A reversible or irreversible transition that involves a change of the crystal structure. Example\: The transition of $\\ce\{NH4Cl\}$ at $\\pu\{469 K\}$ from a $\\ce\{CsCl\}$-type structure to a $\\ce\{NaCl\}$-type structure."
