name: substrate
def: "The chemical entity whose conversion to a product or products is catalysed by one or several enzymes.A solution or dry mixture containing all ingredients which are necessary for the growth of a microbial culture or for product formation.Component in the nutrient medium\, supplying the organisms with carbon \(C-substrate\)\, nitrogen \(N-substrate\)\, etc."
