[Term]
id: goldbook:ST07152
name: surface grafting
def: "Process in which a polymer surface is chemically modified by grafting or by the generation of active sites that can lead to the initiation of a graft polymerization."
comment: "Peroxidation, ozonolysis, high-energy irradiation, and plasma etching are methods of generating active sites on a polymer surface."
property_value: mito:isMentionedBy doi:10.1351/pac200476040889
property_value: hasStatus "current" xsd:string
