comment: "Although the adjective 'solid' is used, the material may be a liquid."
comment: "An example of a solid @P04728@ is a solution of a lithium salt in a poly(oxyethylene) matrix; the ionic conductivity of such material is due to the mobility of lithium cations and their counterions in an electric field."
comment: "The term solid @P04728-1@ should not be confused with the term polymeric electrolyte."
