id: goldbook:T06342
name: thickness of diffusion layer
def: "The distance from the electrode where the ratio \\\[\\frac\{c\\\,-\\\,c_\{\\rm\{e\}\}\}\{c_\{0\}\\\,-\\\,c_\{\\rm\{e\}\}\}\\\] reaches a given value. \(\\\(c_\{\\rm\{e\}\}\\\) is the interfacial concentration\, \\\(c\\\) is the concentration\, \\\(c_\{0\}\\\) is the value in the bulk solution.\) If this ratio is selected as\, say\, 0.99 the corresponding thickness of the diffusion layer is denoted by \\\(\\delta_\{0.99\}\\\)."
