name: total ion current
def: "\(after mass analysis\)\: The sum of the separate ion currents carried by the different ions contributing to the spectrum \(this is sometimes called the reconstructed ion current\).\(before mass analysis\)\: The sum of all the separate ion currents for ions of the same sign before mass analysis."
