[Term]
id: goldbook:T06521
name: tropopause
def: "The region of the atmosphere which joins the troposphere and stratosphere\, and where the decreasing temperature with altitude\, characteristic of the troposphere ceases\, and the temperature increase with height which is characteristic of the stratosphere begins."
