[Term]
id: goldbook:VT07496
name: visible
def: "Region of the electromagnetic spectrum extending from about \\\(400\\ \\rm\{nm\}\\\) to \\\(760\\ \\rm\{nm\}\\\). This is the wavelength region to which the human eye is sensitive. There are no precise limits for the spectral range of visible radiation since they depend upon the amount of radiant power reaching the retina and on the responsivity of the observer."
